      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET SILENCE (4) is a handy type who notched his 3rd career success when too good (22.22) from Box 2 at this track. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. In great recent form and expected to measure up again. SWEET MICHELLE (1) collided with another runner last time and always well back when sixth (23.05) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance. SHAKE NOT STIR (3) is racing well without winning, recording five minors on end, the latest when collided in the run and finishing third in a Grade 5 at Cannington (22.42). Should be in this for a long way. SOUL SURFER (2) was a huge winner last start. Sure to run well again.",
